@startuml

title SerialToI2C App - Static View

package "SerialToI2C App" {
    [I2C Handler] as i2cHandler
    note right of i2cHandler
        API:
        I2CApp_Write(addr, data, len) -> status
        I2CApp_Read(addr, len) -> data, status
    end note
    [Mode Manager] as modeMgr
    note right of modeMgr
        Enforces mutual exclusivity:
        Only Master OR Slave mode active at a time
    end note
    [Master Manager] as masterMgr
    [Slave Manager] as slaveMgr
    [Error Handler] as errorHandler
}

[I2C Master Driver] as i2cMasterDriver
[I2C Slave Driver] as i2cSlaveDriver
[Config Service] as configService

i2cHandler --> modeMgr : Route operation
modeMgr --> masterMgr : Master operations
modeMgr --> slaveMgr : Slave operations
masterMgr --> i2cMasterDriver : Master transfers
slaveMgr --> i2cSlaveDriver : Slave transfers
errorHandler <-- i2cMasterDriver : Error events
errorHandler <-- i2cSlaveDriver : Error events

note bottom of i2cHandler
    No DID/RID awareness.
    Receives typed addr/data from CAC.
end note

@enduml